### [파일 용도] 거래소 API Key 및 거래 내역 API 테스트

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@accessToken = 여기에_로그인후_accessToken_붙여넣기

### Upbit API Key 등록
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/exchange-keys
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "exchange": "UPBIT",
  "apiKey": "여기에_upbit_access_key",
  "secretKey": "여기에_upbit_secret_key"
}

###

### 등록된 거래소 목록 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/exchange-keys
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### Upbit 거래 내역 동기화
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/trades/sync/upbit
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### 거래 내역 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/trades
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### API Key 삭제
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/exchange-keys/UPBIT
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
